      "score": 517,
      "comment_count": 640,
      "score_gain_24h_observed": null,
      "comment_gain_24h_observed": null,
      "keywords": [
        "ask hn"
      ],
      "selection_hints": [
        "AI"
      ],
      "snippet": "I'm curious how people on HN are using AI day to day, and came up with a list of questions I thought could be interesting to know. No need to answer every question of course, just wanted to get a gut feel how people are using AI. 1) What AI subscriptions are you personally paying for? (Claude, ChatGPT/Codex, Cursor, etc) - Which tiers? - Have you purchased multiple subscriptions from the same provider (eg two Claude accounts)? 2) Are you using models outside (or instead) of those subscriptions? "
